      "name": "test_k_equals_1",
      "intent": "When k equals 1, the whole array is one subarray, so the cost must be a[n]‑a[1]. If k == 1, parse the output as integer ans, compute total_span = a[-1]‑a[0], and assert ans == total_span."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_all_elements_equal",
      "intent": "If all elements in the array are equal, every subarray has max = min, so the cost is 0 regardless of k. Check whether all a[i] are equal; if so, parse the output as integer ans and assert ans == 0."
