    },
    {
      "name": "test_upper_bound_simple",
      "intent": "Compute the same sum as in test_lower_bound. This is the cost of the feasible strategy that raises each company to the global maximum and then merges. The minimal increase cannot exceed this cost, so the output must be <= this sum."
