    },
    {
      "name": "test_sequential_upper_bound",
      "intent": "Simulate merging companies in the order they appear in the input: start with the first company, then for each subsequent company, raise it to the current merged maximum (if needed) and merge, accumulating the increase. The total cost is an upper bound, so the output must be <= that cost."
